    "long_instructions": "#Milestone One: Build Schema and Mock Dataset\r\n\r\n**Goal**: Identify a central “value” to explore, design a schema, and generate a prototype dataset that reflects inclusivity and fairness.\r\n\r\n1. **Define Schema:** Inside of a `schema` array, create objects to describe your fields.\r\n2. **Generate Data:** Ask AI to \"Generate 15+ objects matching your defined schema.\r\n3. **Review & Refine:** Paste the data into the `data` array. Delete any entries that are unsafe, biased, or irrelevant to your value.\r\n",
